  "ruleText": "Fam 403.03 Procedure for Imposition of Sanctions. The board shall impose disciplinary sanctions only in accordance with the procedures outlined in Fam 200.\n\nSource. #9672, eff 4-2-10; ss by #12507, INTERIM, eff 4-2-18, EXPIRED: 10-1-18\n\nNew. #12635, eff 10-2-18",
